---
// Token bucket from TestBurstThenRefill: rate 2 tokens/s, burst 3. Levels are exact for that test.
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
const X0 = 90;
const PX = 300; // px per second
const Y0 = 250; // y of level 0
const PY = 50; // px per token
const x = (t: number) => X0 + t * PX;
const y = (lvl: number) => Y0 - lvl * PY;
const path = `M ${x(0)} ${y(3)} L ${x(0)} ${y(0)} L ${x(0.5)} ${y(1)} L ${x(0.5)} ${y(0)} L ${x(1)} ${y(1)}`;
---
<figure class="gp20c">
  <div class="gp20c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Token bucket with burst 3 and rate 2 tokens per second. At time 0 three calls are allowed and the fourth is refused. At 0.5 seconds one token has come back, one call is allowed, and the next is refused.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Token bucket: burst 3, refill 2 tokens per second</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Token bucket: burst 3, nạp 2 token mỗi giây</tspan>
    </text>

    {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((l) => (
      <>
        <line x1={X0} x2={x(1.2)} y1={y(l)} y2={y(l)} class="rule" />
        <text x={X0 - 12} y={y(l) + 5} text-anchor="end" class="m num">{l}</text>
      </>
    ))}
    <text x="20" y="150" class="m" transform="rotate(-90 20 150)" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>tokens</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>token</tspan>
    </text>
    {[0, 0.5, 1].map((t) => (
      <text x={x(t)} y={Y0 + 24} text-anchor="middle" class="m num">{t} s</text>
    ))}

    <path d={path} class="line" />
    <circle cx={x(0)} cy={y(3)} r="5" class="dot" />
    <circle cx={x(0.5)} cy={y(1)} r="5" class="dot" />

    <text x={x(0) + 14} y="120" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>start: bucket full, 3 tokens</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>bắt đầu: bucket đầy, 3 token</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x(0) + 14} y="142" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3 calls allowed, 4th refused</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3 call được phép, call thứ 4 bị từ chối</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x(0.5) + 12} y="166" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0.5 s later: 1 token is back,</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>0,5 s sau: có lại 1 token,</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x(0.5) + 12} y="188" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1 call allowed, next one refused</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1 call được phép, call sau bị từ chối</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="318" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The bucket never holds more than 3 tokens, even after an hour of silence. That cap is the burst size.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bucket không bao giờ chứa quá 3 token, kể cả sau một giờ im lặng. Mức trần đó chính là burst.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Each allowed call spends one token. Time adds tokens back at a fixed rate, up to the burst size.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi call được phép tiêu một token. Thời gian nạp token lại theo tốc độ cố định, tối đa bằng burst.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp20c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp20c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp20c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp20c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp20c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp20c .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp20c .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp20c .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp20c .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp20c .line { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.5; fill: none; }
  .gp20c .dot { fill: var(--gold); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp20c .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp20c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
